          "System.Tags": "sync; reliability; customer-reported",
          "System.Description": "<p>When the server answers <code>503</code> the sync client stops and the user sees stale data until they reload.</p><ul><li>Reproduces on the staging server</li><li>Does not happen on a clean network</li></ul><p>Expected: the client retries with a growing delay.</p><pre><code>const wait = Math.min(this.base * 2 ** attempt, 30_000);</code></pre>",
